#
# Profile "quick": everything the tigris.conf runs but the filesystem scan,
# the only check that takes minutes (it walks every disk). About a
# minute where a full run takes three.
#
#   sudo ./tigris --profile quick
#
# A profile is read after the tigris.conf and its settings win; it holds only
# what differs. This file is preprocessed like the tigris.conf: assignments
# and comments only. (tigris-quick.conf, the tigerrc-quick of 3.3.0, is
# the same as the tigris.conf with this profile.)
#
Tigris_Check_FILESYSTEM=N
